<item><title>Benin forestry agency publishes list of 135 eligible exam candidates</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-forestry-agency-publishes-list-of-135-eligible-exam-45d7bf/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-forestry-agency-publishes-list-of-135-eligible-exam-45d7bf/</guid><category>Benin</category><description>Candidates who passed the written tests for 135 posts in the Directorate-General of Water, Forests and Hunting now face medical checks next week.</description><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 21:55:38 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bj.jpg" length="29969" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bj.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
